sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor S as Staff
participant RS as ReservationsScreen
participant Inv as InventoryViewModel
participant RVM as ReservationViewModel
participant SR as SaleRepository
participant RR as ReservationRepository
participant DB as SQLite
participant Ses as SessionViewModel

S->>RS: Mark Picked Up
RS-->>S: "Paid by" dialog
S->>RS: choose payment method
opt Cash
  RS->>S: CashTenderDialog(item price)
  S-->>RS: amount received
end
RS->>RVM: completePickup(reservation, Inv.items, method)
RVM->>RVM: find reserved item in inventory
alt item deleted or qtyOnHand < 1
  RVM-->>RS: throw PickupBlockedException
  RS-->>S: error snackbar (no stock change)
else in stock
  RVM->>SR: recordSale(Sale with 1 line)
  SR->>DB: transaction: insert sale, deduct stock
  RVM->>RR: update(status = pickedUp)
  RR->>DB: UPDATE reservations
  RVM->>RVM: load()
  par
    RS->>Inv: load()
  and
    RS->>Ses: log("Completed pickup (sale) …")
  end
  RS-->>S: row moves to Picked Up
end
